WEBVTT

NOTE
This file was generated by Descript <www.descript.com>

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:05.380
Abraham: So, what are the consequences and
implications of inadequate cyber security?

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:09.030
Nicole: Cyber security should
be one of the top priorities in

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:11.040
all companies large or small,

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:14.900
as the sophistication and the
number of threats is increasing.

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:19.500
Data is the lifeblood of most
organisations and is the key component

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:23.550
of day-to-day operations, therefore
security breaches that lead to the

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:25.820
loss of data can be catastrophic.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:30.230
Companies and organisations need
a security strategy to cover

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:35.689
networks, servers, workstations,
cloud, applications, and data.

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:39.019
Abraham: Not taking cyber
security seriously can lead to

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.620
irreparable reputational damage,
fines, and issues with licensing

00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:45.519
in case of regulated businesses.

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:51.230
It can also cause adverse media
coverage, increased anxiety and stress

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.050
levels in employees and problems
related to areas such as GDPR.

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:58.940
So, let’s look in a little more
detail at what the consequences

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:00.080
of an attack could be.

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:02.640
Nicole: Operational Disruptions-

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:06.860
Ransomware can lead to hackers
holding a company to ransom by

00:01:06.940 --> 00:01:11.770
infiltrating and accessing their
system, and its core datasets, and

00:01:11.770 --> 00:01:13.510
then asking for money, or else!

00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:18.360
This can lead to the shutting down of
the company’s entire IT infrastructure

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:23.920
and business critical systems, to isolate
the damage, investigate and recover.

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:28.720
For companies that do not have a
recovery plan or back-ups in place, it

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:32.890
may take weeks or months to get back
to where they were before the attack.

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:37.600
This can cause disruptions to business
operations, have a negative impact on

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:42.730
productivity, causing customers to go
elsewhere, resulting in a loss of revenue.

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:45.650
Abraham: Legal Ramifications

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:50.710
Data breaches involving customer’s and
commercial partner’s personal information,

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.259
can lead to lawsuits against the company.

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:58.470
These can have the impact of lowering
trust and confidence, and may involve

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:03.520
hefty fines from regulatory bodies,
legal fees and expensive court cases.

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:08.120
In case of regulated businesses, the
authorities may even restrict companies

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:12.380
from carrying certain operations until
legal investigations are concluded,

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:16.899
to see how an attack could take place,
and to make sure it won’t happen again.

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:19.179
Nicole: Financial loss

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:23.480
All cyber criminal acts, whether
direct or indirect, can have

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:25.500
a negative financial impact.

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:31.030
Loss of business, legal fees, fines,
cost of containing an attack or

00:02:31.030 --> 00:02:35.980
breach, compensation pay-outs, and a
potential reduction in share price.

00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:41.280
Data breaches especially, can be hard
for a business to overcome and renew

00:02:41.329 --> 00:02:46.010
trust in former clients and give
confidence to new ones, therefore making

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:48.079
it possible for companies to go under.

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:52.320
Some businesses have a
‘never-going-to-happen-to-me’ attitude

00:02:52.320 --> 00:02:57.229
towards cyber security and have inadequate
security measures in place in general.

00:02:57.599 --> 00:03:01.820
But in this day and age, everyone should
air on the side of caution and change that

00:03:01.850 --> 00:03:04.260
attitude to ‘it could easily happen to me!

